<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" data-theme="light">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <title>Preview — Vitória IA | Unio</title>
    {% include 'components/platform_favicon.html.twig' %}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Sora:wght@600;700;800&display=swap">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/admin-lte@3.2/dist/css/adminlte.min.css">
    {% include 'components/unio_theme_vars.html.twig' %}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('css/unio-app.min.css') }}?v=276">
    <style>
        html, body { height: 100%; overflow: hidden; margin: 0; }
        body { background: var(--bg); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 28px; }
        #capture-root {
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-2);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(15,23,42,0.12);
        }
        .preview-shell {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr 380px;
            width: 1340px;
            height: 840px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .preview-sidebar {
            background: var(--sidebar-bg) !important;
            border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
            height: 100%;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .preview-brand {
            padding: 16px 18px 14px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .preview-brand img { height: 26px; width: auto; }
        .preview-nav { flex: 1; padding: 8px 0; overflow: hidden; }
        .preview-nav-section {
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--text-3);
            padding: 10px 16px 4px;
        }
        .preview-main {
            background: var(--bg);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            min-width: 0;
        }
        .preview-topbar {
            height: 54px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 20px;
            gap: 14px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .preview-topbar-title { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
        .preview-topbar-title h1 {
            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-1);
            margin: 0;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }
        .preview-topbar-title p { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-3); margin: 1px 0 0; }
        .preview-topbar-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-shrink: 0; }
        .preview-content {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 16px 20px 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        /* Painel Vitória — espelha .helix-drawer do CSS real */
        .vitoria-panel {
            background: var(--bg);
            border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            height: 100%;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        /* Helix header usa as classes reais */
        .helix-avatar-icon {
            width: 38px;
            height: 38px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: var(--brand-gradient);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 16px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .helix-title {
            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-1);
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }
        .helix-subtitle {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--text-3);
            margin: 1px 0 0;
            font-weight: 400;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="preview-shell" id="capture-root">
    {# Sidebar esquerda #}
    <aside class="preview-sidebar">
        <div class="preview-brand">
            {% include 'components/platform_logo.html.twig' with { variant: 'full' } only %}
        </div>
        <nav class="preview-nav">
            <span class="preview-nav-section">Navegação</span>
            <ul class="nav nav-sidebar flex-column" role="menu">
                <li class="nav-item sidebar-hub-pick-item">
                    <a href="#" class="nav-link active">
                        <i class="fas fa-gauge-high nav-icon"></i>
                        <p>Dashboard</p>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item sidebar-hub-pick-item">
                    <a href="#" class="nav-link">
                        <i class="fas fa-id-card nav-icon"></i>
                        <p>Recursos Humanos</p>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item sidebar-hub-pick-item">
                    <a href="#" class="nav-link">
                        <i class="fas fa-tower-broadcast nav-icon"></i>
                        <p>Núcleo TI</p>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item sidebar-hub-pick-item">
                    <a href="#" class="nav-link">
                        <i class="fas fa-sitemap nav-icon"></i>
                        <p>Processos</p>
                    </a>
                </li>
            </ul>
            <span class="preview-nav-section">Atalhos</span>
            <ul class="nav nav-sidebar flex-column" role="menu">
                <li class="nav-item sidebar-hub-pick-item">
                    <a href="#" class="nav-link">
                        <i class="fas fa-calendar-days nav-icon"></i>
                        <p>Agenda do time</p>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item sidebar-hub-pick-item">
                    <a href="#" class="nav-link">
                        <i class="fas fa-file-invoice nav-icon"></i>
                        <p>Relatórios</p>
                    </a>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </aside>

    {# Conteúdo principal (parcialmente visível — foco está na Vitória) #}
    <div class="preview-main">
        <header class="preview-topbar">
            <div class="preview-topbar-title">
                <h1>Dashboard</h1>
                <p>Visão geral · Unio 2 · Tecnologia</p>
            </div>
            <div class="preview-topbar-actions">
                <button type="button" class="btn-unio-ghost btn-sm" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:var(--accent-dim);border-color:var(--accent-line);color:var(--accent);">
                    <i class="fas fa-wand-magic-sparkles" style="font-size:11px;"></i> Vitória IA
                </button>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="preview-content">
            <div class="row stats-row mb-3">
                <div class="col-md-6 d-flex">
                    <div class="unio-card stat-card w-100">
                        <div class="card-icon"><i class="fas fa-users"></i></div>
                        <div class="stat-card-body">
                            <div class="card-value">142</div>
                            <div class="card-label">Funcionários ativos</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6 d-flex">
                    <div class="unio-card stat-card w-100">
                        <div class="card-icon"><i class="fas fa-headset"></i></div>
                        <div class="stat-card-body">
                            <div class="card-value">24</div>
                            <div class="card-label">Chamados TI abertos</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="unio-card" style="padding:16px;">
                <div class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Processos recentes</div>
                <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;">
                    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface);">
                        <i class="fas fa-user-plus" style="color:var(--accent);font-size:13px;width:16px;text-align:center;"></i>
                        <div style="flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-1);">Admissão — Lucas Carvalho</div>
                        <span class="status-badge status-badge--info ti-badge">Em curso</span>
                    </div>
                    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface);">
                        <i class="fas fa-file-signature" style="color:var(--accent);font-size:13px;width:16px;text-align:center;"></i>
                        <div style="flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-1);">Revisão de cargos Q2</div>
                        <span class="status-badge status-badge--warning ti-badge">Pendente</span>
                    </div>
                    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface);">
                        <i class="fas fa-calendar-check" style="color:var(--accent);font-size:13px;width:16px;text-align:center;"></i>
                        <div style="flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-1);">Férias · Equipe TI · Jul/2025</div>
                        <span class="status-badge status-badge--success ti-badge">Aprovado</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    {# Painel Vitória IA — usa classes reais .helix-* do unio-app.css #}
    <div class="vitoria-panel">
        <div class="helix-header" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
            <div class="helix-header-brand">
                <div class="helix-avatar-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="helix-title">Vitória</div>
                    <div class="helix-subtitle">Copiloto contextual · Unio</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="helix-header-actions">
                <button class="helix-close-btn" type="button" aria-label="Fechar">
                    <i class="fas fa-xmark"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="helix-messages">
            <div class="helix-msg helix-msg--assistant">
                <div class="helix-msg-bubble">
                    <p>Olá! Sou a <strong>Vitória</strong>, seu copiloto no Unio.</p>
                    <p>Posso analisar KPIs, gerar relatórios, resumir chamados TI e muito mais. O que você precisa?</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="helix-msg helix-msg--user">
                <div class="helix-msg-bubble">
                    Qual o status do SLA de TI este mês?
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="helix-msg helix-msg--assistant">
                <div class="helix-msg-bubble">
                    <p>📊 <strong>SLA de TI — Junho 2025</strong></p>
                    <p>• Taxa geral de cumprimento: <strong>94%</strong> (meta: 95%)<br>
                    • Chamados P1 encerrados no prazo: <strong>2/3</strong><br>
                    • Tempo médio de resolução: <strong>4h 12min</strong></p>
                    <p>O chamado <code>#TI-1042</code> (VPN — P1) está em andamento e pode impactar a meta. Deseja abrir um alerta para o gestor?</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="helix-msg helix-msg--user">
                <div class="helix-msg-bubble">
                    Sim, envia um alerta para Carlos M.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="helix-msg helix-msg--assistant">
                <div class="helix-msg-bubble">
                    <p>✅ <strong>Alerta enviado</strong> para Carlos M. via notificação e e-mail.</p>
                    <p>O chamado foi escalado para prioridade máxima. Deseja ver os detalhes?</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="helix-suggestions">
            <div class="helix-chips">
                <button class="helix-chip" type="button">Ver chamados P1</button>
                <button class="helix-chip" type="button">Relatório de SLA</button>
                <button class="helix-chip" type="button">Admissões pendentes</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="helix-composer">
            <div class="helix-composer-inner">
                <span style="flex:1;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-3);font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;padding:4px 0;">
                    Pergunte qualquer coisa sobre sua operação…
                </span>
                <button type="button" style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;border:none;background:var(--action);color:#fff;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;">
                    <i class="fas fa-arrow-up" style="font-size:12px;"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
